2539:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the TIM One Pulse Time Base according to the specified
2540:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         parameters in the TIM_HandleTypeDef and initializes the associated handle.
2541:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
2542:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
2543:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
2544:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: call @ref HAL_TIM_OnePulse_DeInit() before HAL_TIM_OnePulse_Init()
2545:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   When the timer instance is initialized in One Pulse mode, timer
2546:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
2547:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
2548:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  htim TIM One Pulse handle
2549:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  OnePulseMode Select the One pulse mode.
2550:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the following values:
2551:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_OPMODE_SINGLE: Only one pulse will be generated.
2552:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_OPMODE_REPETITIVE: Repetitive pulses will be generated.
2553:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @retval HAL status
