2930:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the TIM Encoder Interface and initialize the associated handle.
2931:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
2932:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
2933:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
2934:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: call @ref HAL_TIM_Encoder_DeInit() before HAL_TIM_Encoder_Init()
2935:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Encoder mode and External clock mode 2 are not compatible and must not be selected toge
2936:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: A call for @ref HAL_TIM_Encoder_Init will erase the settings of @ref HAL_TIM_Config
2937:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         using TIM_CLOCKSOURCE_ETRMODE2 and vice versa
2938:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   When the timer instance is initialized in Encoder mode, timer
2939:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
2940:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
2941:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  htim TIM Encoder Interface handle
2942:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  sConfig TIM Encoder Interface configuration structure
