7086:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c **** /**
7087:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Configure the TI1 as Input.
7088:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIMx to select the TIM peripheral.
7089:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICPolarity The Input Polarity.
7090:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
7091:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_RISING
7092:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_FALLING
7093:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_BOTHEDGE
7094:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICSelection specifies the input to be used.
7095:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
7096:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_DIRECTTI: TIM Input 1 is selected to be connected to IC1.
7097:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_INDIRECTTI: TIM Input 1 is selected to be connected to IC2.
7098:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_TRC: TIM Input 1 is selected to be connected to TRC.
7099:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICFilter Specifies the Input Capture Filter.
7100:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter must be a value between 0x00 and 0x0F.
